    {
      "id": "source-concrete-member-right-and-cutaway-front",
      "description": "One reinforced-concrete member in oblique perspective; the exposed steel cage is on the left, concrete occupies the right. The concrete has a plain top and a stippled front, with the front opened around the four right-hand stirrups; the far right is solid concrete. Steel bars continue into this member, not beside an unrelated block.",
